<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Assessment Complete — Learn.ai</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0A0F1E;
            --surface: #111827;
            --card: #1E293B;
            --border: #1F2937;
            --purple: #7C3AED;
            --blue: #2563EB;
            --gold: #F59E0B;
            --cyan: #22D3EE;
            --green: #10B981;
            --red: #EF4444;
            --text: #F1F5F9;
            --muted: #94A3B8;
            --dim: #64748B;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; }

        nav {
            background: rgba(17,24,39,0.95);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            height: 56px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }
        .brand { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }

        .results-wrap { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1rem; }

        .results-card {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .check-icon { color: var(--green); font-size: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .results-title { color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

        .score-ring {
            width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%;
            border: 4px solid var(--border);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            margin: 1.5rem auto;
            position: relative;
        }
        .score-ring::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute; inset: -4px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 4px solid transparent;
            border-top-color: var(--green);
            border-right-color: var(--green);
            transform: rotate(<%= result.percentage * 3.6 %>deg);
        }
        .score-num { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
        .score-label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--dim); }

        .score-detail { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

        .summary-grid { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .summary-box {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            text-align: center;
            flex: 1;
        }
        .summary-num { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; }
        .summary-num.green { color: var(--green); }
        .summary-num.gold { color: var(--gold); }
        .summary-num.red { color: var(--red); }
        .summary-label { color: var(--dim); font-size: 0.72rem; margin-top: 2px; }

        .results-hint { color: var(--dim); font-size: 0.82rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.5; }
        .results-hint i { color: var(--cyan); }

        .btn-dashboard {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple), var(--blue));
            border: none; color: white; padding: 14px 40px; border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
            text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
        }
        .btn-dashboard:hover { opacity: 0.9; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(124,58,237,0.4); color: white; }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .results-card { padding: 1.5rem; }
            .summary-grid { flex-direction: column; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
    <a class="brand" href="/"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill"></i> Learn.ai</a>
</nav>

<div class="results-wrap">
    <div class="results-card">
        <div class="check-icon"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i></div>
        <h2 class="results-title">Assessment Complete</h2>

        <div class="score-ring">
            <div class="score-num"><%= result.percentage %>%</div>
            <div class="score-label"><%= result.totalCorrect %>/<%= result.totalQuestions %></div>
        </div>

        <p class="score-detail">Your knowledge graph has been initialized across <strong><%= summary.total %></strong> concepts.</p>

        <div class="summary-grid">
            <div class="summary-box">
                <div class="summary-num green"><%= summary.strong %></div>
                <div class="summary-label">Strong</div>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-box">
                <div class="summary-num gold"><%= summary.developing %></div>
                <div class="summary-label">Developing</div>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-box">
                <div class="summary-num red"><%= summary.needsWork %></div>
                <div class="summary-label">Needs Work</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="results-hint">
            <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>
            Concepts you're strong in are already unlocked on your graph. Focus areas are highlighted so you know exactly where to start.
        </p>

        <a href="/" class="btn-dashboard"><i class="bi bi-graph-up me-2"></i>Go to Dashboard</a>
    </div>
</div>
<script src="/js/translator.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
